          "field": "summary",
          "value": "A demake for the classic roguelike The Binding of Isaac originally developed by Edmund McMillen and Florian Himsl. This homebrew redesign of the game was built from the ground up to run on the original Game Boy hardware itself (meaning it will require an emulator to play on the PC).",
