        {
          "field": "summary",
          "value": "The Binding of Isaac: Repentance is the ultimate edition of the award-winning roguelike twin-stick shooter. It includes all the content from previous editions of The Binding of Isaac (Rebirth, Afterbirth and Afterbirth+) plus Repentance, the game's final and biggest-ever expansion, adding hundreds of additional new features, modes, and improvements. Experience the modern classic like it's never been seen before!",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "summary_es",
          "value": "The Binding of Isaac: Repentance es la edición definitiva del premiado shooter roguelike de doble palanca. Incluye todo el contenido de las ediciones anteriores de The Binding of Isaac (Rebirth, Afterbirth y Afterbirth+), además de Repentance, la última y más grande expansión del juego, que añade cientos de nuevas funciones, modos y mejoras. ¡Vive este clásico moderno como nunca antes lo habías visto!",
          "source": "claude",
          "manual": false
        },
        {
          "field": "year",
          "value": "2021",
          "source": "igdb",
          "manual": false
        }
